      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0d58bcf8cb7b451eb3be7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于走到这一步的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27af54655fff4b6e05624d7d27e86e9efe72f974f7e35cdcac968df7a06b3444",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b416e8fa4405362cfd2f4715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宣扬胜利名号的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d158c0a106ba20db5a6b74432350ea423c7d568f3fb2b5dea9ea09a44b2306c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c13bcc80bbf456b1961ad6bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天一定要获胜并提升知名度的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "745b200628aec1cc4868844446ff23182794503be0e92175c7f71670006421d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cfafdcbe0843c88cff271ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3737cd239952f126e445632afbbcebd0ccc63e57b6b7d8ea704875e4aacafadb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc38e774c4fad59a07b7d3ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次受到瞩目的是<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "072b6849911ab67667475f9a50691395f3f0f92ea91beafea95a85632f52e45a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450fd58c5c185b777c67ff82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次备受瞩目的训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54de60993b91de60ad794a90215c7e9fd20c9447d59bb13e06db2927afdc7d9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb6ae5c09a8323538b90e25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这次大赛中的总胜率为<total_win_percent>%，展现出总是让粉丝着迷的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b2f5536caaa78181ce85facda34c0e48181eebfba6202ca0369470120793380",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7f79ddd7300ef97eb094da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从预赛到重要竞赛，战胜了这一切的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b25f99638014b4c9bf64dafe4189afe82be5103b79b6a8b7994ed2618c0a7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb40d0988877b0af88b79351",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对会是场激烈的竞赛，不能将冠军拱手让人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb3977c220a7eec829e01e7fecf742ae589dd00dbbe44cdf99a2beb24785b9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f4527ef2e6bfc00699e864",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要获胜就能掌握冠军的竞赛，绝对不能输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a9515b99d1ed42103ba167b6b375899ee5128a73d3fa62a7345b4053222d25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "100201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f3437272e8fdf936571d4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的新锐<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9179131b61546caf041324fe95de32fac0c411b1374dd6193ca7ae1061a4715",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8248df3675bb95ab31ca963b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然最近胜利并未降临，但其培育的本事确属货真价实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a4f3181db0dca5da6c55940476a572bb71d5e870e579be9925dff00c827472",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f4058f9c027336bd508662",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战都未获胜，虽然连战连败的气氛浓厚，但竞赛中的表现还不坏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89464241f99fbc47dc72d071cae077b06a551f0bb04595caabca7e9eabd60acf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d23ab9528430e8e9c64fc0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然竞赛表现都是距离胜利只差一步，但实力其实不仅如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f634f8e0eea4d1d4ce44693e56cbe5fcecf8cabc2826ed5a1eb04da8277b62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6bd9e085b4fcfc10eb235a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然都是无法照常实力发挥的竞赛，但已能窥见良好的征兆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "410d31ff7222378ea1e64102b581d34f0c20a81bbad67184b0bda55e20d594c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89d119f56f68db9ae23c841",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来只要期待会跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9fdf9627cb09f70b041a80c2a465f6f0ea4ca538932cf00d88927f4fe6add6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bcef71e80fb5b12c464f81e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "务必要在这里挥别不好的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45af785115ad4318bb19394e412fa432235fcf2f7c2274a055a06ddbe61bd19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:122ef5d9e6edbe928050e4f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够在这场竞赛中，拭去不好的感觉吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5084e4312e7a80c85d320236ae640af9ec95eba2ca5e073243e6f0bb05ad460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467d2d76cde716f0707f1887",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够在眼前的竞赛上发挥以往的实力，掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93100d5dc03a9f22ee68a180aafd55365057952e6e316d12e3f646c8b9a9eef0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bf2662a24262475d803606",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即将展现在众人面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173a619161c65c949190c95e91a3cdb2c8b14fa83a96f9322076cd2315f73f75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4d45a989bb1a86f8cf0a1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但至今跑出的精彩竞赛已经让观众为之倾倒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0e727b72fc147ed35a2ad5abcaa2d301f5903b058900cf10a2b80276a48a02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8184230c5657dc81afecd675",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3737cd239952f126e445632afbbcebd0ccc63e57b6b7d8ea704875e4aacafadb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75cf0875cfe79f4e679508d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "头号冠军候补的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd9440ecbe4709e04537b14b6c708115affcee570e65ebc7adaf852d02b61cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557eb8f885e972f6372b1660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次大赛的功臣<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db32d3d9b516a5e81f2a92a93317e94078c75c7d846bfec18eb2f8234d23bb70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ac548de2bb18eacca1b92b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注想扳回一城的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "247e267cf55bc1b320c1e14b8444ca2e920fb4934e885c18707a1e21a6a5c3cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7a308907b0bac93301a15f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正报名参赛这次大赛的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "941e4efbd16e385fcc6aae3054a0efae036394c28cb5fa7313bba5585030ebdb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e89676d39f0e86bc587e76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但看来已经习惯本次大赛的气氛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70af9b3e1a6e9d58683a7d518ac07e71ff2b847641b60f3073ba12e9d359a5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14c04b1a1c31a61f4b7e6958",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在预选赛中的总胜率为<total_win_percent>%，以压倒性的战绩攀升至此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a347102d42d74a32267465c390f6b459619d0998778d32485c14d4ae68fe0b20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea321caef009beee41f4b4e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如彗星般闪现，以无人能及的实力席卷大赛，奔往决赛的路畅通无阻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7393622294944ef6f91ddcdf8557530ed71cd1cad17a4439b7bd4e09313b2143",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a73e0ebccb3f4eab3b199e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但的确暗藏某种资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a37a43baecb2c3544a4e44f9263cd4260addc5351ec0fc12f1d658691addfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f78655b4a5c8f92d4eba6c2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "足以获胜的强悍，足以获胜的高速。决赛时也能见识到那股实力吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "728d0504eaf29d294d02b41213ff6585f2cb04af459370e1ace0a137f8bf90c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86741a9b5c80c19ef7cc5bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有办法顺利获得优胜，实现有始有终的成果吗？绝对不要错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69d6cff5304c04f175d8a8464040e652cbc936f8784845e2ff20d4fb8465063",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bade81e164483ec0415b6cad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之希望这一战能够获胜，或许至今的努力方向不正确。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bc32e3773facb0f8491341640a9885c69134b056a704c21fe110b7505631aa7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e30a69864991f55c087f3291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然有的竞赛没能掌握胜利，不过在获胜的竞赛中展现出的精彩表现已证明了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "378d325b5502360d1f72e8e5bc2682f6bf11cc43e66db525bfb8a80ffb60a090",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6dc3ee286e3810ceded98c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战仅得1胜的成绩虽不甚理想，但还是要朝下场胜利确实迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0423fb17a00b49e1a232c9a0e9feedb8db030027e875d608dc6792aec1e043",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68f86950f8c624e566b84c33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为20%，虽不理想却是处于蓄势待发的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db7e0f0a8b9f9d8415b8e2356c238ec178683a6c4751d386038944cb30ba524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd313bf9d5df9f2940d6189",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有办法借着这场竞赛扶摇直上吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd357db8d6cfe34f5b16a0be39106e0b98685d199084f2421106bba1a05dfa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f44845632d5151de5c74c76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要透过获胜改变情势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b20057f5fd1efb572c9d12b013e6561a1ac184f1f1992be373e24f2e23077",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7510c4a9830d5681b28bc715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉可以期待这场更加鼓起干劲的竞赛。",
